<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-V32SZKZH30"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());
  gtag('config', 'G-V32SZKZH30');
</script>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Perchd: You're the Best Salesperson for Your Own Product</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<meta name="description" content="Perchd is a brand strategist for founders and executives. AI runs the strategy, a real person writes the words, and you choose how involved you want to be.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#F0A93A">
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://perchd.space/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Perchd: You're the Best Salesperson for Your Own Product">
<meta property="og:description" content="AI runs the strategy. A real person writes the words. You choose how involved you want to be.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://perchd.space/og-image.png">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Perchd: You're the Best Salesperson for Your Own Product">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="AI runs the strategy. A real person writes the words. You choose how involved you want to be.">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://perchd.space/og-image.png">


<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#FFFFFF;
    --bg-alt:#FFFFFF;
    --ink:#17141C;
    --muted:#6B6259;
    --line:#EFE7D6;
    --accent:#F0A93A;
    --accent-ink:#211404;
    --accent-soft:#FCEACB;
    --dark:#17141C;
    --dark-2:#211D28;
    --white:#FFFFFF;
    --font-display:'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    --font-body:'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    --radius:18px;
    --shadow:0 20px 50px -20px rgba(23,20,28,0.28);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--font-body); line-height:1.6; overflow-x:hidden;}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--font-display); margin:0; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
  p{margin:0;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px;}
  @media (max-width:640px){ .wrap{padding:0 20px;} }
  .pill{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:7px 14px; border-radius:999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600;}
  .pill--soft{background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent-ink);}

  .btn{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; font-family:var(--font-body); font-weight:700; font-size:0.96rem; padding:14px 26px; border-radius:999px; border:2px solid transparent; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none; line-height:1; transition:transform .15s ease;}
  .btn--primary{background:var(--accent); color:var(--accent-ink);}
  .btn--primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn--ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--line);}
  .btn--ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink);}
  .btn--onDark{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color:#fff; border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);}
  .btn--sm{padding:10px 18px; font-size:0.86rem;}
  .btn--dark{background:var(--dark); color:#fff;}

  .site-header{position:sticky; top:0; z-index:40; background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 88%, transparent); backdrop-filter:blur(10px); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .nav{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:18px 0;}
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:800;}
  .nav__links{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:30px;}
  .nav__link{font-size:0.94rem; color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;}
  .nav__link:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .nav__actions{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .nav__links a.nav__link{display:none;} }

  /* HERO */
  .hero{padding:80px 0 60px; position:relative;}
  .hero__badge{margin-bottom:22px;}
  .hero__title{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.6vw,4rem); line-height:1.06; max-width:760px;}
  .hero__title mark{background:none; color:var(--accent);}
  .hero__sub{margin-top:22px; font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--muted); max-width:560px;}
  .hero__actions{margin-top:32px; display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center;}
  .hero__note{margin-top:14px; font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--muted);}

  .hero__top{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.15fr 0.85fr; gap:40px; align-items:center;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .hero__top{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  .hero__orbit{display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:20px;}
  .hero__orbit-caption{font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; text-align:center;}

  .orbit{position:relative; width:280px; height:280px; --orbit-radius:118px;}
  @media (max-width:520px){ .orbit{width:220px; height:220px; --orbit-radius:88px;} }
  .orbit__path{position:absolute; inset:22px; border:1.5px dashed var(--line); border-radius:50%;}
  .orbit__center{position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:82px; height:82px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; z-index:2; box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden;}
  .orbit__center img{width:52px; height:52px; object-fit:contain;}
  .orbit__spinner{position:absolute; inset:0;}
  .orbit__item{position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; width:0; height:0; transform:rotate(var(--angle));}
  .orbit__arm{position:absolute; top:0; left:0; transform:translateY(calc(var(--orbit-radius) * -1));}
  .orbit__unrotate{position:absolute; top:0; left:0; transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(calc(var(--angle) * -1));}
  .p-icon{width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:var(--muted); box-shadow:0 6px 16px -8px rgba(23,20,28,0.25);}
  .p-icon--linkedin{background:#0A66C2; border-color:#0A66C2; color:#fff;}
  .p-icon--facebook{background:#1877F2; border-color:#1877F2; color:#fff;}
  .p-icon--instagram{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FEDA75 0%,#FA7E1E 30%,#D62976 55%,#962FBF 75%,#4F5BD5 100%); border-color:transparent; color:#fff;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){
    .orbit__spinner{animation:orbitspin 18s linear infinite;}
    .orbit__counter{animation:orbitspin-reverse 18s linear infinite;}
  }
  @keyframes orbitspin{ from{transform:rotate(0deg);} to{transform:rotate(360deg);} }
  @keyframes orbitspin-reverse{ from{transform:rotate(0deg);} to{transform:rotate(-360deg);} }

  .mockup-stage{position:relative; margin-top:64px; padding:20px 0 40px;}
  .blob{position:absolute; border-radius:50%; filter:blur(70px); z-index:0; opacity:0.55;}
  .blob--a{width:420px; height:420px; background:var(--accent); top:-80px; left:6%;}
  .blob--b{width:340px; height:340px; background:#8E7BD8; top:60px; right:8%; opacity:0.35;}

  .mockup-window{position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--white); border-radius:var(--radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line); transform:rotate(-0.6deg);}
  .mockup-topbar{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:14px 20px; background:var(--dark-2); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);}
  .mockup-dots{display:flex; gap:6px;}
  .mockup-dots span{width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; display:block;}
  .mockup-dots span:nth-child(1){background:#F0605A;} .mockup-dots span:nth-child(2){background:#F0B23A;} .mockup-dots span:nth-child(3){background:#3FBE6B;}
  .mockup-address{flex-grow:1; text-align:center; font-size:0.8rem; color:#BDB5C4; font-family:var(--font-body);}
  .mockup-body{display:flex; min-height:380px;}
  .mockup-side{width:76px; background:var(--dark); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:26px; padding:26px 0;}
  .mockup-side .ic{width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);}
  .mockup-side .ic--on{background:var(--accent);}
  .mockup-main{flex-grow:1; padding:32px 36px; background:var(--bg-alt);}
  .mockup-eyebrow{font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .mockup-statement{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.35rem; line-height:1.4; max-width:560px;}
  .mockup-chips{display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:20px;}
  .chip{padding:7px 13px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600;}
  .mockup-bars{display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:8px; height:70px; margin-top:26px;}
  .mockup-bars span{width:16px; border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; background:var(--accent);}
  .mockup-caption{margin-top:10px; font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted);}

  /* PROOF STRIP */
  .proof{padding:50px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .proof__label{font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:26px;}
  .proof__grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:30px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .proof__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .proof__stat{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:2rem; color:var(--accent-ink); background:var(--accent-soft); display:inline-block; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:8px;}
  .proof__desc{margin-top:10px; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.95rem; max-width:280px;}

  /* GAP */
  .gap{padding:100px 0 40px;}
  .gap__head{max-width:600px; margin-bottom:44px;}
  .gap__head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.5rem);}
  .gap__grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:22px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .gap__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .gap__card{background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:32px;}
  .gap__icon{width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:18px;}
  .gap__card h3{font-size:1.2rem; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .gap__card p{color:var(--muted); font-size:0.97rem;}

  /* THESIS */
  .thesis{padding:90px 0 30px;}
  .thesis h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,2.8rem); max-width:820px; line-height:1.25;}
  .thesis span.hl{background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent-ink); padding:0 8px; border-radius:6px;}
  .thesis p{margin-top:20px; max-width:600px; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.03rem;}

  /* FEATURES */
  .features{padding:70px 0 110px;}
  .feature-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:56px; align-items:center; padding:56px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .feature-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .feature-row.rev .feature-text{order:2;}
  @media (max-width:820px){ .feature-row, .feature-row.rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .feature-row.rev .feature-text{order:0;} }
  .feature-num{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--accent-ink); background:var(--accent-soft); display:inline-block; padding:4px 11px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:16px;}
  .feature-text h3{font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:12px;}
  .feature-text p{color:var(--muted); font-size:1rem; max-width:420px;}
  .feature-visual{background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:26px; min-height:200px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;}

  .chat-bubble{background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:12px 16px; font-size:0.9rem; max-width:80%; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .chat-bubble--q{border-bottom-left-radius:4px;}
  .chat-bubble--a{border-bottom-right-radius:4px; margin-left:auto; background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent-ink); font-weight:600;}

  .brief-list{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .brief-item{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:12px 14px; font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:600;}
  .brief-dot{width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent); flex-shrink:0;}

  .segmented{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .segmented span{padding:10px 16px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--white); font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted);}
  .segmented span.on{background:var(--ink); color:var(--bg); border-color:var(--ink);}

  /* PRICING */
  .pricing{padding:30px 0 120px;}
  .pricing__head{max-width:600px; margin-bottom:50px;}
  .pricing__head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.5rem);}
  .pricing__head p{margin-top:14px; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.02rem;}
  .pricing__grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .pricing__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; max-width:440px;} }
  .plan{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:32px 28px; background:var(--white); display:flex; flex-direction:column; position:relative;}
  .plan--rec{border-color:var(--accent); box-shadow:var(--shadow); transform:translateY(-14px);}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .plan--rec{transform:none;} }
  .plan__tag{position:absolute; top:-14px; left:26px; background:var(--accent); color:var(--accent-ink); font-size:0.76rem; font-weight:700; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px;}
  .plan__altitude{font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .plan__name{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.4rem;}
  .plan__for{margin-top:8px; font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--muted); min-height:40px;}
  .plan__price{margin-top:18px; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:6px;}
  .plan__price .amount{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:2.2rem;}
  .plan__price .cadence{font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--muted);}
  .plan__features{list-style:none; margin:22px 0 0; padding:0; flex-grow:1;}
  .plan__features li{padding:10px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:0.9rem;}
  .plan__features li:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .plan__cta{margin-top:24px; width:100%;}

  /* EXAMPLE OUTPUT */
  .examples{padding:20px 0 120px;}
  .examples__head{max-width:600px; margin-bottom:44px;}
  .examples__head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.5rem);}
  .examples__head p{margin-top:14px; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.02rem;}
  .examples__grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .examples__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .example-card{background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:26px;}
  .example-card p.quote{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.5;}
  .example-card p.who{margin-top:16px; font-size:0.84rem; color:var(--muted); font-weight:600;}

  /* FAQ */
  .faq{padding:20px 0 120px; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;}
  .faq__head{margin-bottom:40px; text-align:center;}
  .faq__head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.5rem);}
  details.faq__item{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:20px 22px; margin-bottom:12px; background:var(--white);}
  details.faq__item summary{cursor:pointer; list-style:none; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:20px; font-weight:700; font-size:1rem;}
  details.faq__item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .faq__icon{flex-shrink:0; width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent-soft); position:relative;}
  .faq__icon::before, .faq__icon::after{content:''; position:absolute; background:var(--accent-ink); top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);}
  .faq__icon::before{width:11px; height:1.6px;}
  .faq__icon::after{width:1.6px; height:11px; transition:opacity .15s ease;}
  details[open] .faq__icon::after{opacity:0;}
  .faq__answer{margin-top:14px; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.96rem;}

  /* FINAL CTA */
  .final{background:var(--accent); color:var(--accent-ink); padding:90px 0; text-align:center;}
  .final h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem); max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;}
  .final__actions{margin-top:32px;}
  .final .btn--dark{background:var(--dark); color:#fff;}

  /* FOOTER */
  .footer{background:var(--dark); color:#DCD5CB; padding:60px 0 30px;}
  .footer__top{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:40px; flex-wrap:wrap; padding-bottom:40px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);}
  .footer__brand{max-width:280px;}
  .footer__brand .brand{color:#fff; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .footer__brand p{color:#A79E93; font-size:0.92rem;}
  .footer__col h4{font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:0.85rem; color:#8B8177; margin-bottom:14px; font-weight:700;}
  .footer__col a{display:block; color:#DCD5CB; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.92rem; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .footer__col a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .footer__bottom{padding-top:24px; font-size:0.84rem; color:#8B8177;}

  /* MODAL */
  .modal-overlay{position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(23,20,28,0.55); backdrop-filter:blur(3px); z-index:100; display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:24px;}
  .modal-overlay.is-open{display:flex;}
  .modal{position:relative; background:var(--white); border-radius:20px; max-width:480px; width:100%; max-height:90vh; overflow-y:auto; padding:38px 32px 32px;}
  .modal__close{position:absolute; top:18px; right:18px; background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid var(--line); width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer; font-size:1rem; color:var(--muted); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;}
  .modal h3{font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .modal__sub{color:var(--muted); font-size:0.95rem; margin-bottom:26px;}
  .form-row{margin-bottom:16px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px;}
  .form-row label{font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--muted);}
  .form-row input, .form-row select{font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:0.98rem; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); width:100%;}
  .form-row input:focus, .form-row select:focus{outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:1px;}
  .form-row--split{flex-direction:row; gap:12px;}
  .form-row--split > div{flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px;}
  .modal__success{text-align:center; padding:20px 0;}
  .modal__success h3{margin-bottom:10px;}
  .modal__success p{color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:24px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Perchd" width="26" height="26" style="display:block;">
      Perchd
    </div>
    <nav class="nav__links">
      <a class="nav__link" href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a class="nav__link" href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a class="nav__link" href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav__actions">
      <a class="nav__link" href="#" style="display:inline;">Log in</a>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" data-open-modal>Start your brief</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero__top">
        <div class="hero__copy">
          <span class="pill pill--soft hero__badge">For founders & executives</span>
          <h1 class="hero__title">You're the <mark>best salesperson</mark> for your own product.</h1>
          <p class="hero__sub">Perchd runs the strategy: positioning, audience, and weekly direction. A real person still writes the words, and you choose how much of that person is you.</p>
          <div class="hero__actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-open-modal>Start your brief</button>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero__note">8-minute setup. No credit card.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero__orbit">
          <div class="orbit">
            <div class="orbit__path"></div>
            <div class="orbit__center"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Perchd" width="52" height="52"></div>
            <div class="orbit__spinner">
              <div class="orbit__item" style="--angle:0deg">
                <div class="orbit__arm">
                  <div class="orbit__unrotate" style="--angle:0deg">
                    <div class="orbit__counter">
                      <span class="p-icon p-icon--linkedin" aria-label="LinkedIn">
                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><text x="12" y="17" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="800" fill="currentColor">in</text></svg>
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="orbit__item" style="--angle:120deg">
                <div class="orbit__arm">
                  <div class="orbit__unrotate" style="--angle:120deg">
                    <div class="orbit__counter">
                      <span class="p-icon p-icon--facebook" aria-label="Facebook">
                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14.5 8.5H16V5.7c-.3-.04-1.3-.13-2.5-.13-2.5 0-4.1 1.5-4.1 4.3v2.2H7v3.1h2.4V21h3.2v-7.3h2.4l.4-3.1h-2.8V10c0-.9.25-1.5 1.9-1.5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="orbit__item" style="--angle:240deg">
                <div class="orbit__arm">
                  <div class="orbit__unrotate" style="--angle:240deg">
                    <div class="orbit__counter">
                      <span class="p-icon p-icon--instagram" aria-label="Instagram">
                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><circle cx="16" cy="8" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="hero__orbit-caption">Everywhere your audience already is</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mockup-stage">
        <div class="blob blob--a"></div>
        <div class="blob blob--b"></div>
        <div class="mockup-window">
          <div class="mockup-topbar">
            <div class="mockup-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="mockup-address">app.perchd.com/brief</div>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-body">
            <div class="mockup-side">
              <div class="ic ic--on"></div>
              <div class="ic"></div>
              <div class="ic"></div>
              <div class="ic"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mockup-main">
              <p class="mockup-eyebrow">Your brand brief · Auto-updated weekly</p>
              <p class="mockup-statement">Maya writes for investors and future hires who need proof before promises. The angle: most Series A pitches oversell traction. Hers shows the messy middle.</p>
              <div class="mockup-chips">
                <span class="chip">The problem, told plainly</span>
                <span class="chip">Proof in progress</span>
                <span class="chip">Why now</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mockup-bars">
                <span style="height:38%;"></span><span style="height:60%;"></span><span style="height:44%;"></span><span style="height:80%;"></span><span style="height:66%;"></span><span style="height:92%;"></span>
              </div>
              <p class="mockup-caption">This week's reach, by post</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="proof__label">Why this exists</p>
      <div class="proof__grid">
        <div>
          <span class="proof__stat">$500–$8K/mo</span>
          <p class="proof__desc">already spent on LinkedIn ghostwriting alone, before any strategy work is included.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="proof__stat">3–5x</span>
          <p class="proof__desc">more inbound leads for founders who post consistently versus those who don't.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="proof__stat">15x</span>
          <p class="proof__desc">more algorithmic weight a comment carries than a like, so engagement strategy matters as much as writing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gap">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="gap__head">
        <h2>Right now you're choosing between two problems</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="gap__grid">
        <div class="gap__card">
          <div class="gap__icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4L20 20M20 4L4 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>The content mill</h3>
          <p>Fast, cheap, and it shows. Generic phrasing, no real point of view, and LinkedIn's own model is starting to quietly bury posts that pattern-match to AI text.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="gap__card">
          <div class="gap__icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>The retainer</h3>
          <p>Real writing that sounds like you, for $1,500–$8,000 a month, whether this is your top priority this quarter or the fifth thing on your list.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="thesis">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Perchd splits the two jobs a brand actually needs: <span class="hl">the thinking</span>, and <span class="hl">the writing</span>.</h2>
      <p>AI handles positioning, audience, and weekly direction, the part it's actually gotten good at. A person handles the sentences, the part your audience can tell apart. The split is also what lets the price flex with exactly how much writing you want to keep for yourself.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="feature-num">01 · The interview</span>
          <h3>Fifteen minutes of real questions</h3>
          <p>Not a five-field form. We ask what you've actually built, who needs to hear it, and the take you've been too careful to post.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-visual">
          <div class="chat-bubble chat-bubble--q">What's something people in your industry are wrong about?</div>
          <div class="chat-bubble chat-bubble--a">Everyone says you need a huge team to move fast...</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-row rev">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="feature-num">02 · The weekly brief</span>
          <h3>Weekly briefs, not weekly guesswork</h3>
          <p>That interview becomes a standing strategy, turned into specific angles and structure tied to what's actually happening in your business each week.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-visual">
          <div class="brief-list">
            <div class="brief-item"><span class="brief-dot"></span> The problem, told plainly</div>
            <div class="brief-item"><span class="brief-dot"></span> A milestone from this week</div>
            <div class="brief-item"><span class="brief-dot"></span> The take nobody else will post</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="feature-num">03 · You hold the pen</span>
          <h3>Choose who writes it</h3>
          <p>Write from the brief yourself, polish a first draft into your own words, or hand it to a writer who already knows your positioning cold.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-visual">
          <div class="segmented">
            <span class="on">Write it myself</span>
            <span>Edit a draft</span>
            <span>Hand it off</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pricing__head">
        <h2>Plans that flex with how involved you want to be</h2>
        <p>Every plan starts with the same strategy foundation. What changes is who holds the pen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing__grid">
        <div class="plan">
          <p class="plan__altitude">Ground level</p>
          <p class="plan__name">Starter</p>
          <p class="plan__for">For founders who write themselves and just need direction.</p>
          <div class="plan__price"><span class="amount">$79</span><span class="cadence">/month</span></div>
          <ul class="plan__features">
            <li>Full strategy onboarding & brand brief</li>
            <li>Weekly content briefs: angles, hooks, outlines</li>
            <li>Voice-consistency check before you post</li>
            <li>Quarterly strategy refresh</li>
            <li>LinkedIn + 1 additional platform</li>
          </ul>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost plan__cta" data-open-modal data-plan="starter">Choose Starter</button>
        </div>
        <div class="plan plan--rec">
          <span class="plan__tag">Recommended</span>
          <p class="plan__altitude">Halfway up</p>
          <p class="plan__name">Pro</p>
          <p class="plan__for">For founders who want a head start, not a blank page.</p>
          <div class="plan__price"><span class="amount">$199</span><span class="cadence">/month</span></div>
          <ul class="plan__features">
            <li>Everything in Starter</li>
            <li>AI first-draft for every brief, then you edit it into your voice</li>
            <li>Weekly performance read-out reshapes next week's briefs</li>
            <li>Monitoring for how AI search engines describe you</li>
            <li>Monthly async strategist review</li>
          </ul>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary plan__cta" data-open-modal data-plan="pro">Choose Pro</button>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">
          <p class="plan__altitude">The perch</p>
          <p class="plan__name">Agency</p>
          <p class="plan__for">For founders who want this fully off their plate.</p>
          <div class="plan__price"><span class="amount">From $1,800</span><span class="cadence">/month</span></div>
          <ul class="plan__features">
            <li>Everything in Pro</li>
            <li>A dedicated human writer paired to your brief</li>
            <li>Comment and engagement management</li>
            <li>Live strategist check-ins, not async</li>
            <li>Custom posting cadence, 3–5x per week</li>
          </ul>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost plan__cta" data-open-modal data-plan="agency">Talk to us</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="examples">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="examples__head">
        <h2>The kind of clarity this is built to produce</h2>
        <p>Example brief output. Not real customer quotes, just what a finished positioning statement actually looks like.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="examples__grid">
        <div class="example-card">
          <p class="quote">"Most fintech founders lead with security. We lead with the three founders who got scammed before they built this."</p>
          <p class="who">Example: seed-stage fintech founder</p>
        </div>
        <div class="example-card">
          <p class="quote">"Everyone says hire fast. We shipped faster with five people than our last company did with fifty, and I can prove it."</p>
          <p class="who">Example: Series A SaaS founder</p>
        </div>
        <div class="example-card">
          <p class="quote">"I'm not the loudest person in healthcare AI. I'm the one who's been in the room when it went wrong."</p>
          <p class="who">Example: healthcare AI executive</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="faq__head"><h2>Questions worth answering directly</h2></div>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Is this just ghostwriting with extra steps?<span class="faq__icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">No. The strategy layer (positioning, audience, weekly briefs) is the actual product, and it's there on every plan. Who writes the final sentences is what changes as you move up.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Will it actually sound like me?<span class="faq__icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">That's the point of keeping a person in the writing loop. On Starter and Pro, you finish the sentences yourself. On Agency, your writer works from your real voice profile and words, not a generic template.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Do I have to write anything on the cheaper plans?<span class="faq__icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">On Starter, yes, but from a sharp brief instead of a blank page. On Pro, you're editing an AI-drafted starting point. Agency is the only plan where you don't write at all.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>What happens if my strategy needs to change?<span class="faq__icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">Refreshes are built in: quarterly on Starter, more often as you move up, and you can trigger one anytime something changes sooner.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Is this just for LinkedIn?<span class="faq__icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">LinkedIn is where most founders start, but every plan includes at least one more platform, and the strategy itself isn't platform-specific.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Can I switch plans later?<span class="faq__icon"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">Yes, anytime. Most founders start on Starter or Pro and move to Agency once writing it themselves costs more than the price difference.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Say the thing only you can say. Let Perchd handle the noise.</h2>
      <div class="final__actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--dark" data-open-modal>Start your brief</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="footer__top">
      <div class="footer__brand">
        <div class="brand">Perchd</div>
        <p>A brand strategist for people who lead. Strategy from AI, sentences from a person, involvement on your terms.</p>
